{"id":"BAM-2ug","title":"Implement diminishing returns for fused block HP","description":"Currently fused blocks add all HP together plus a bonus, giving no strategic trade-off for fusion.\n\n**New formula (Option 3):** Fixed 50% bonus per additional block\n```\nfusedHp = baseHp + (blockCount - 1) × baseHp × 0.5\n```\n\n| Blocks | Separate HP | Fused HP | HP Lost |\n|--------|-------------|----------|---------|\n| 2      | 6           | 4.5      | 25%     |\n| 3      | 9           | 6        | 33%     |\n| 5      | 15          | 9        | 40%     |\n\n**Trade-off:** Fused blocks are easier to destroy (less total HP), but you get bonus score from combos and destroy all at once.\n\n**Implementation:**\n1. Add BLOCK_HP to imports in BlockSpawner.ts\n2. Replace HP calculation in tryMergeBlocks() (lines 276-293):\n   - Get base HP from BLOCK_HP[block.color]\n   - Apply: Math.ceil(baseHp + (blockCount - 1) * baseHp * 0.5)","status":"open","priority":2,"issue_type":"feature","created_at":"2026-01-25T00:04:12.351359+01:00","created_by":"cg","updated_at":"2026-01-25T00:04:22.380192+01:00"}
{"id":"BAM-2zh","title":"Block hitting player from top should disappear","description":"When a falling block hits the player from the top, the block should be destroyed/disappear rather than its current behavior.\n\n**Expected:** Block disappears on contact with player from above\n**Current:** Block persists (or other undesired behavior)\n\n**Implementation:** In the block-player collision handler, if the block is above the player and falling, destroy the block.","status":"open","priority":2,"issue_type":"bug","created_at":"2026-01-25T00:05:30.761999+01:00","created_by":"cg","updated_at":"2026-01-25T00:05:30.761999+01:00"}
